{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35139","headline":"题休休亭 · 司空图","name":"题休休亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咄，诺。\n休休休，莫莫莫。\n伎两虽多性灵恶，赖是长教闲处着。\n休休休，莫莫莫。\n一局棋，一炉药。\n天意时情可料度，白日偏催快活人。\n黄金难买堪骑鹤，若曰尔何能，荅言耐辱莫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}